Package: specmill
Title: Local API Wrapper Maintenance Tools
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person('Sean', 'Thimons', role = c('aut', 'cre'), email = 'thimons.sean@gmail.com')
Description: Development tools for local schema parsing, wrapper generation,
    generated file ownership and hook validation. Generated clients retain
    their own request helpers and hook execution and need no runtime tooling.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: cli, digest, dplyr, fs, jsonlite, jsonvalidate (>= 1.5.0), purrr, readr, roxygen2, stringr, tibble, tidyr, V8, yaml, yaml12 (>= 0.1.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), httr2 (>= 1.3.0), curl, callr, httpuv, promises, later, withr, knitr, rmarkdown, vcr (>= 2.0.0), cachem, rlang, mirai, shiny
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://seanthimons.github.io/specmill/, https://github.com/seanthimons/specmill
BugReports: https://github.com/seanthimons/specmill/issues
